## Configuration Previews

### main.tf

```hcl
resource "aws_instance" "xfusion_ec2" {
  ami           = "ami-0c55b159cbfafe1f0"
  instance_type = "t2.micro"

  tags = {
    Name = "xfusion-ec2"
  }
}

resource "aws_eip" "xfusion_eip" {
  domain   = "vpc"
  instance = aws_instance.xfusion_ec2.id

  tags = {
    Name = "xfusion-eip"
  }
}
```

### outputs.tf

```hcl
output "KKE_instance_name" {
  value = aws_instance.xfusion_ec2.tags["Name"]
}

output "KKE_eip" {
  value = aws_eip.xfusion_eip.public_ip
}
```

### provider.tf

The existing provider configuration uses:

- AWS provider version `5.91.0`
- Region `us-east-1`
- Lab endpoint `http://aws:4566`
- Skip credentials validation
- Skip account ID validation
- S3 path-style addressing

The existing provider configuration was preserved.

